WEBVTT

00:00:07.780 --> 00:00:11.780
I heard what you said. You want
to go to the research facility.

00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:14.530
If that's the case, stop making waves.

00:00:14.530 --> 00:00:15.790
Meaning what?

00:00:15.790 --> 00:00:21.500
The best way to defy authority
is to pretend to play their game.

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:24.130
You'll help me find Naomi?

00:00:24.130 --> 00:00:29.720
Of course. It may not seem like it,
but I consider her a comrade.

00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:31.970
I'll collect intel on the facility.

00:00:31.970 --> 00:00:35.060
In the meantime, let's just do our duty.

00:00:38.770 --> 00:00:40.890
It's him.

00:00:40.890 --> 00:00:43.060
Nagi. The sublevel tunnel.

00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:47.570
They put him in a van

00:00:47.570 --> 00:00:49.820
and drove off.

00:00:49.820 --> 00:00:52.820
But if it really was Nagi...

00:00:52.820 --> 00:00:55.780
If Nagi is still alive,
I'd like to see him again.

00:01:16.850 --> 00:01:18.140
Nagi!

00:01:20.770 --> 00:01:22.140
Nagi!

00:01:25.310 --> 00:01:27.270
Wait! Nagi!

00:01:42.040 --> 00:01:43.370
Nagi.

00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:07.400
<i>A crime in reality</i>

00:02:07.400 --> 00:02:08.690
<i>For Heaven's sake</i>

00:02:08.690 --> 00:02:10.610
<i>Accepts any fake</i>

00:02:10.610 --> 00:02:13.030
<i>And disappears</i>

00:02:13.030 --> 00:02:16.110
<i>Piling the eternity in fantasy</i>

00:02:16.110 --> 00:02:17.660
<i>Won't take it at all</i>

00:02:17.660 --> 00:02:18.740
<i>I get sick</i>

00:02:18.740 --> 00:02:20.660
<i>A girl looking back</i>

00:02:20.660 --> 00:02:23.080
<i>Casts the miracle</i>

00:02:23.080 --> 00:02:26.040
<i>Into the instant world </i>

00:02:26.040 --> 00:02:30.920
<i>Did you lie?</i>

00:02:30.920 --> 00:02:32.760
<i>Did you lie?</i>

00:02:32.760 --> 00:02:35.840
<i>Spit the venom </i>

00:02:35.840 --> 00:02:40.600
<i>I know why</i>

00:02:40.600 --> 00:02:44.180
<i>I've found a game of ecstasy</i>

00:02:44.180 --> 00:02:46.810
<i>Red Criminal gets life</i>

00:02:46.810 --> 00:02:49.270
<i>I've never been in love</i>

00:02:49.270 --> 00:02:55.110
<i>Don't know when I started</i>
<i>getting sick of this world</i>

00:02:55.110 --> 00:02:56.700
<i>We will fly</i>

00:02:56.700 --> 00:02:59.530
<i>Someday I won't be crying</i>

00:02:59.530 --> 00:03:04.370
<i>I've been sacrificing myself</i>

00:03:04.370 --> 00:03:06.790
<i>Not to hurt anybody</i>

00:03:18.210 --> 00:03:21.970
The Hospital's Secrets

00:03:23.800 --> 00:03:26.600
"Level 4"
"Level 3"
"Level 2"
"Level 1"

00:03:27.770 --> 00:03:30.440
I'm glad I found you.

00:03:30.440 --> 00:03:32.360
I've been worried.

00:03:33.530 --> 00:03:37.240
But it's okay now. Come back with us.

00:03:38.450 --> 00:03:39.950
Nagi?

00:03:39.950 --> 00:03:42.620
How could I possibly go back?

00:03:42.620 --> 00:03:43.450
Huh?

00:03:43.450 --> 00:03:45.620
How could I possibly go back?!

00:03:50.460 --> 00:03:54.380
I think I know what they did to you.

00:03:54.380 --> 00:03:55.630
No one's blaming you.

00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:58.800
You think you know? Really?

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:01.390
Because even I don't understand.

00:04:03.100 --> 00:04:07.600
My brain suddenly felt like it went numb.

00:04:07.600 --> 00:04:11.270
Then it was like my mind
was being violently scrambled.

00:04:14.480 --> 00:04:15.900
Nagi.

00:04:19.360 --> 00:04:23.410
Yuito, run. You can't be here.

00:04:32.630 --> 00:04:35.000
Let's get out of here together.

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:40.380
I'll buy you some time. You guys go, now!

00:04:40.380 --> 00:04:41.970
Then I'm fighting, too!

00:04:41.970 --> 00:04:43.350
You can't!

00:04:43.350 --> 00:04:45.010
It's like I have a switch.

00:04:45.010 --> 00:04:47.640
I might kill you if it's flipped,

00:04:47.640 --> 00:04:48.890
just like last time.

00:04:48.890 --> 00:04:53.190
I don't care! I'll just have to stop you!

00:04:53.190 --> 00:04:55.110
You'll all end up like me!

00:04:55.110 --> 00:04:58.690
No! They might even turn you into Others!

00:04:58.690 --> 00:05:00.650
Turn us into Others?

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:08.250
I'm sorry, Yuito.

00:05:08.250 --> 00:05:09.410
Nagi!

00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:26.930
Thank you, Yuito.

00:05:26.930 --> 00:05:29.270
Sorry I couldn't go with you.

00:05:38.940 --> 00:05:40.400
Forgive me.

00:05:42.570 --> 00:05:44.070
Forgive me.

00:06:11.680 --> 00:06:13.850
Luka! Why'd you do that?!

00:06:13.850 --> 00:06:16.230
You weren't thinking straight.

00:06:16.230 --> 00:06:17.520
Nagi was right.

00:06:17.520 --> 00:06:20.730
We should get away from here ASAP.

00:06:20.730 --> 00:06:21.860
But...!

00:06:21.860 --> 00:06:25.490
We've just learned a state secret.

00:06:25.490 --> 00:06:27.570
It's a risk staying any longer.

00:06:28.870 --> 00:06:30.040
They're here!

00:06:35.670 --> 00:06:36.580
We're outnumbered.

00:06:36.580 --> 00:06:38.500
Yuito, we have to run!

00:06:41.590 --> 00:06:45.590
He took out that many Others by himself?

00:06:45.590 --> 00:06:49.550
Impressive. It seems the experiment
is on the right track.

00:06:49.550 --> 00:06:51.970
He cost us valuable time.

00:06:55.350 --> 00:06:57.100
Head to the shelter!

00:07:21.130 --> 00:07:23.550
I think we gave them the slip.

00:07:25.130 --> 00:07:26.930
Is everyone all right?

00:07:26.930 --> 00:07:28.720
Major General Fubuki?

00:07:28.720 --> 00:07:30.800
We're all unharmed.

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:32.430
That's a relief.

00:07:32.430 --> 00:07:35.600
If you're contacting us now,

00:07:35.600 --> 00:07:38.600
it means the government knows what we did.

00:07:38.600 --> 00:07:43.110
Yes. It seems they are
looking into eliminating you.

00:07:43.110 --> 00:07:45.990
Did you know about this?

00:07:45.990 --> 00:07:48.610
What did they do to Nagi there?!

00:07:49.820 --> 00:07:51.320
I knew.

00:07:51.320 --> 00:07:55.000
It's partly my fault
Nagi ended up like that.

00:07:56.250 --> 00:07:58.120
What does <i>that </i>mean?

00:07:58.120 --> 00:08:05.010
That hospital brainwashes those
the government finds "inconvenient."

00:08:05.010 --> 00:08:10.090
Nagi ended up like that because
he witnessed Naomi's metamorphosis.

00:08:11.800 --> 00:08:16.270
I've protected all of you under
the pretext of monitoring your moves.

00:08:16.270 --> 00:08:20.190
But Nagi was abducted before that.

00:08:20.190 --> 00:08:25.110
That's right. He was wounded
and sent to the hospital.

00:08:25.110 --> 00:08:26.610
That was when...

00:08:26.610 --> 00:08:28.360
Forgive me.

00:08:28.360 --> 00:08:31.490
If only I'd have moved quicker...

00:08:31.490 --> 00:08:33.490
That's...

00:08:33.490 --> 00:08:36.660
...not your fault, Major General.

00:08:36.660 --> 00:08:40.920
U-Um, what's this about
Naomi morphing into an Other?

00:08:40.920 --> 00:08:42.790
She wasn't killed in action?

00:08:44.540 --> 00:08:49.300
So Naomi wasn't killed in action.
She was turned into an Other.

00:08:49.300 --> 00:08:52.340
Turned into an Other?

00:08:52.340 --> 00:08:54.600
Here's the situation.

00:08:54.600 --> 00:08:57.970
As an Ichijo, this will be
hard for you to hear.

00:08:57.970 --> 00:08:59.940
O-Okay...

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:05.860
That hospital researches psionics
under a national project

00:09:05.860 --> 00:09:08.860
run by the New Himukan government.

00:09:08.860 --> 00:09:13.620
They're tuning the brain to produce
even more powerful psionics.

00:09:13.620 --> 00:09:17.830
Their work yielded two by-products.

00:09:17.830 --> 00:09:20.830
You must mean personality rehabilitation.

00:09:20.830 --> 00:09:25.670
That's right, along with metamorphosis.

00:09:25.670 --> 00:09:30.220
Exposure to a special substance
transforms life forms into Others.

00:09:30.220 --> 00:09:34.050
It works on any life form with a brain.

00:09:34.050 --> 00:09:39.810
Hold on. Are you saying the government
turned Naomi into an Other?

00:09:39.810 --> 00:09:41.270
That's right.

00:09:42.350 --> 00:09:45.520
It's too risky for us to talk too long.

00:09:45.520 --> 00:09:48.440
Stand by until I give you further orders.

00:09:48.440 --> 00:09:49.400
Wait!

00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:56.530
How could you have known about this
and not done anything about it?

00:09:56.530 --> 00:09:58.080
It was easy.

00:09:58.080 --> 00:10:02.460
I'm part of the system,
and the government has me on a leash.

00:10:04.790 --> 00:10:07.920
Luka's heard at least some
of this from Karen.

00:10:07.920 --> 00:10:10.260
You can ask him any questions.

00:10:16.930 --> 00:10:22.310
Luka, is it true what
Major General Fubuki said?

00:10:22.310 --> 00:10:23.390
Yes.

00:10:23.390 --> 00:10:30.280
This goes all the way back to when
he was engaged to Alice Ichijo.

00:10:30.280 --> 00:10:31.610
Alice was the daughter

00:10:31.610 --> 00:10:34.860
of the OSF Hospital's
former director general.

00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:39.870
She got engaged to Major General Fubuki
of the Spring Pharmaceuticals family.

00:10:39.870 --> 00:10:42.120
Aunt Alice.

00:10:42.120 --> 00:10:45.790
She joined the OSF after she was scouted.

00:10:45.790 --> 00:10:48.540
But she was killed in the line of duty.

00:10:48.540 --> 00:10:49.960
She was...

00:10:51.670 --> 00:10:53.420
...turned into an Other.

00:10:55.090 --> 00:10:57.180
That was also the government?

00:10:57.180 --> 00:11:01.010
No, I heard it was an accident
while on combat duty.

00:11:01.010 --> 00:11:04.940
What kind of accident
turns a human into an Other?

00:11:04.940 --> 00:11:06.270
I don't get it.

00:11:06.270 --> 00:11:10.860
My brother and Major General Fubuki
started looking into it.

00:11:10.860 --> 00:11:13.940
In the process,
they discovered the government's

00:11:13.940 --> 00:11:16.700
personality rehabilitation,
metamorphosis tech,

00:11:16.700 --> 00:11:20.910
and the surveillance systems
in our cities.

00:11:20.910 --> 00:11:24.120
If the project was led by
the New Himukan government,

00:11:24.120 --> 00:11:26.830
I wonder if my dad knew about it.

00:11:28.170 --> 00:11:29.880
I believe he knew.

00:11:29.880 --> 00:11:35.720
Or it might be more accurate to say
he was at the center of it all.

00:11:35.720 --> 00:11:40.510
Did my brother know?

00:11:40.510 --> 00:11:43.350
I alone was kept in the dark.

00:11:44.890 --> 00:11:48.770
What do you want, General Spring?

00:11:48.770 --> 00:11:53.070
I heard your subordinates are
meddling in things better left alone.

00:11:53.070 --> 00:11:55.780
That's why I'm here.

00:12:04.910 --> 00:12:07.410
This is where Naomi is?

00:12:12.040 --> 00:12:15.420
Are you really coming with me?

00:12:15.420 --> 00:12:17.800
This isn't going to be easy.

00:12:17.800 --> 00:12:22.350
I'd love to be used and abused
if it's for you, my dear Kasane.

00:12:22.350 --> 00:12:23.010
I also want--

00:12:23.010 --> 00:12:24.760
I'm shocked, Kasane.

00:12:24.760 --> 00:12:26.850
We're comrades in arms.

00:12:26.850 --> 00:12:29.140
You can count on us for anything.

00:12:29.140 --> 00:12:29.850
I want to--

00:12:29.850 --> 00:12:34.940
Dang, isn't it just like us to defect and
then go against our new government?

00:12:38.070 --> 00:12:38.820
I--

00:12:38.820 --> 00:12:40.360
I feel the same.

00:12:40.360 --> 00:12:42.030
Based on Arashi's intel,

00:12:42.030 --> 00:12:45.490
I mapped out a route
that should be relatively safe.

00:12:45.490 --> 00:12:46.950
Thank you, Haruka.

00:12:46.950 --> 00:12:48.830
We're counting on you.

00:12:52.500 --> 00:12:54.210
Hmm?

00:12:54.210 --> 00:12:56.500
You're not coming, Shiden?

00:12:57.880 --> 00:13:00.050
Let's get on with it!

00:13:08.350 --> 00:13:11.270
This place leaves nothing
to the imagination.

00:13:11.270 --> 00:13:15.230
It's got super shady written all over it.

00:13:19.900 --> 00:13:22.450
We need the password.

00:13:22.450 --> 00:13:25.080
Haruka, any ideas?

00:13:25.080 --> 00:13:28.700
Sorry. There's no way to look it up.

00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:32.250
Relax. I've got this.

00:13:36.710 --> 00:13:38.590
The gate unlocked?

00:13:38.590 --> 00:13:42.180
When did you have time
to learn something like that?

00:13:42.180 --> 00:13:46.510
I guess it means Seiran's security
isn't that impressive, either.

00:13:48.520 --> 00:13:51.690
I thought this was
an Others research facility?

00:13:51.690 --> 00:13:53.560
It looks like a factory.

00:13:53.560 --> 00:13:57.270
And what's with that weird smell?

00:13:57.270 --> 00:13:59.400
I think I'm gonna be sick.

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:02.110
What in the world are they making?

00:14:06.280 --> 00:14:07.240
These are...

00:14:08.990 --> 00:14:10.580
Something ring a bell?

00:14:10.580 --> 00:14:11.870
These ampules.

00:14:11.870 --> 00:14:16.790
The Seiran Regional Force dropped one
of these the day Naomi was morphed.

00:14:16.790 --> 00:14:17.960
And...

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:23.970
When I was little, I remember seeing
ampules like these at home.

00:14:23.970 --> 00:14:27.180
The Randall family owns
Randall Industries, right?

00:14:27.180 --> 00:14:30.350
Could that have something to do with them?

00:14:31.600 --> 00:14:36.400
It might, but I can't be sure.

00:14:36.400 --> 00:14:39.900
At any rate, there are too many unknowns.

00:14:39.900 --> 00:14:42.900
Arashi, now what are you doing?

00:14:42.900 --> 00:14:49.870
The rapid acquisition of vital intel via
the most reliable method is Espionage 101.

00:14:49.870 --> 00:14:52.330
Whoa, impressive, Arashi.

00:14:52.330 --> 00:14:55.250
It's like the security system
was only for show.

00:14:55.250 --> 00:14:58.340
I'm sure glad she's on our side.

00:14:58.340 --> 00:15:03.130
I bet she could expose things from
long ago that one would rather forget.

00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:08.600
I can hear you.
And I'd be happy to oblige.

00:15:08.600 --> 00:15:10.260
Arashi?

00:15:10.260 --> 00:15:11.810
What's this?

00:15:30.660 --> 00:15:33.410
Everyone! Escape route 10 o'clock!

00:15:37.620 --> 00:15:38.880
Let's move!

00:15:52.810 --> 00:15:54.930
What is this place?

00:15:54.930 --> 00:15:56.770
Are we in Wonderland?

00:15:56.770 --> 00:16:00.440
Yeah, I feel like our bodies
shrunk way down.

00:16:10.200 --> 00:16:11.830
Sis.

00:16:11.830 --> 00:16:12.780
Huh?

00:16:12.780 --> 00:16:14.790
I knew she was here.

00:16:14.790 --> 00:16:17.080
Sis, where are you?!

00:16:17.080 --> 00:16:18.670
Sis!

00:16:19.870 --> 00:16:23.670
Kasane! I get how you feel,
but you need to quiet down!

00:16:26.550 --> 00:16:28.840
Ka... sane.

00:16:28.840 --> 00:16:32.550
That voice. Sis? Is that you?!

00:16:32.550 --> 00:16:36.560
Ka... sa... ne.

00:16:36.560 --> 00:16:38.980
Sis.

00:16:38.980 --> 00:16:40.850
I knew it was you.

00:16:40.850 --> 00:16:43.820
Is that really you, Kasane?

00:16:43.820 --> 00:16:46.690
She's speaking to Naomi via brain talk.

00:16:46.690 --> 00:16:49.240
That means she's somewhere near.

00:16:49.240 --> 00:16:53.030
I'm detecting Naomi's presence.
I think I can locate her!

00:16:53.030 --> 00:16:54.950
Beyond that door to your right.

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:56.580
Heading there now!

00:16:56.580 --> 00:16:59.960
Wait. Kasane, I'm...

00:17:01.330 --> 00:17:03.590
No, don't open it!

00:17:09.170 --> 00:17:12.430
Please, don't come any closer.

00:17:32.700 --> 00:17:35.200
Kasane.

00:17:36.160 --> 00:17:38.040
Sis.

00:17:39.660 --> 00:17:45.380
So this is what Naomi has become.

00:17:45.380 --> 00:17:49.510
This is Naomi?!

00:17:49.510 --> 00:17:52.550
I'm sorry, Sis.

00:17:52.550 --> 00:17:57.260
This is all because
you were protecting me.

00:17:57.260 --> 00:18:00.180
It's all right, Kasane.

00:18:00.180 --> 00:18:04.650
I'm just glad you're safe.

00:18:04.650 --> 00:18:07.270
But...

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:09.650
No, it's all right.

00:18:09.650 --> 00:18:14.070
I'm so happy to see you alive and well.

00:18:15.700 --> 00:18:17.740
Thanks to you.

00:18:17.740 --> 00:18:19.910
I'm doing well.

00:18:19.910 --> 00:18:25.670
I was so worried.
Just hearing that puts me at ease.

00:18:25.670 --> 00:18:28.500
Why were <i>you </i>worried?!

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:34.220
I was the one who was always worried!
I felt like I had to protect you!

00:18:34.220 --> 00:18:38.350
You're so clumsy, I need
to be there to protect you.

00:18:38.350 --> 00:18:40.850
That's not very nice, Kasane.

00:18:40.850 --> 00:18:43.180
But in the end...

00:18:45.100 --> 00:18:49.400
Sis. I'm sorry. I'm so sorry.

00:18:51.440 --> 00:18:56.410
Kasane, all that apologizing
is making this hard on Naomi.

00:18:56.410 --> 00:18:57.660
She's right.

00:18:57.660 --> 00:19:03.660
If you were worried about Naomi,
at least be content you're both alive.

00:19:03.660 --> 00:19:06.460
Plus, we now know where she is.

00:19:06.460 --> 00:19:10.340
Forgive me, Commander Kyoka.

00:19:10.340 --> 00:19:14.130
Just look at what I've become.

00:19:14.130 --> 00:19:16.430
It's all right. Are you well?

00:19:16.430 --> 00:19:18.180
You're not sick or wounded?

00:19:18.180 --> 00:19:21.850
The people here aren't mistreating you?

00:19:21.850 --> 00:19:24.020
I'm fine.

00:19:24.020 --> 00:19:30.020
The people here are kind,
even to an Other like me.

00:19:30.020 --> 00:19:32.440
Sis.

00:19:32.440 --> 00:19:38.110
But without the ampules,
it's truly agonizing.

00:19:38.110 --> 00:19:41.530
I'm not even able to communicate.

00:19:42.490 --> 00:19:44.830
Ka... sa... ne...

00:19:44.830 --> 00:19:48.960
Please leave and don't come back.

00:19:48.960 --> 00:19:54.010
I want you to forget about me.

00:19:55.090 --> 00:19:57.680
No! I can't do that, Sis!

00:19:57.680 --> 00:20:00.970
After all I did to finally find you!

00:20:00.970 --> 00:20:04.020
The ampule's drug has worn off.

00:20:04.020 --> 00:20:06.480
Kasane, forgive me.

00:20:06.480 --> 00:20:09.100
Please, you must leave.

00:20:09.100 --> 00:20:11.940
Go now. Hurry!

00:20:11.940 --> 00:20:14.030
Kasane, we must go!

00:20:14.030 --> 00:20:17.110
This is what's best for Naomi!

00:20:17.110 --> 00:20:18.530
Sis!

00:20:26.450 --> 00:20:28.870
I knew this might happen.

00:20:47.980 --> 00:20:52.060
Maybe we've been dancing to your tune
the whole time, Major General Karen.

00:20:52.060 --> 00:20:55.530
We're right in the palm of your hand.

00:20:55.530 --> 00:20:59.240
The ampules allow Naomi
to retain some semblance of herself.

00:20:59.240 --> 00:21:02.990
But that's no more
than a stop-gap measure.

00:21:02.990 --> 00:21:06.490
Is there a way to restore Naomi
to human form?

00:21:06.490 --> 00:21:11.500
For that, Kasane,
we'll need your psionic power.

00:21:11.500 --> 00:21:12.880
My power?

00:21:12.880 --> 00:21:15.840
Stand by while we prepare.

00:21:15.840 --> 00:21:19.800
I will do everything
to keep her alive till then.

00:21:19.800 --> 00:21:25.640
You can't build trust when
too many secrets are being kept.

00:21:25.640 --> 00:21:27.310
Speak your mind.

00:21:27.310 --> 00:21:29.270
I've but one question.

00:21:29.270 --> 00:21:34.980
What's in these ampules
that you've been injecting into Naomi?

00:21:44.780 --> 00:21:47.870
I'm relieved you
made it back in one piece.

00:21:47.870 --> 00:21:50.120
Thanks to you, Major General Fubuki.

00:21:50.120 --> 00:21:53.380
You put in a good word for us
with Chief Sumeragi?

00:21:53.380 --> 00:21:55.460
Something like that.

00:21:55.460 --> 00:22:00.760
But if anything else happens,
it'll get harder to persuade him.

00:22:00.760 --> 00:22:02.680
You better watch yourselves.

00:22:02.680 --> 00:22:04.300
Yes, sir.

00:22:04.300 --> 00:22:05.930
Commander.

00:22:05.930 --> 00:22:10.230
This was sent to you
from the OSF Hospital.

00:22:10.230 --> 00:22:11.810
For me?

00:22:11.810 --> 00:22:16.020
You left the hospital
before you got your meds.

00:22:16.020 --> 00:22:17.820
Maybe they sent them to you.

00:22:17.820 --> 00:22:19.230
Maybe.

00:22:20.780 --> 00:22:22.450
These are...!

00:24:08.760 --> 00:24:11.930
A Dubious Wonder Drug
